# DragonTTS — self-contained sub-service (own Dockerfile/pyproject/venv under
# dragontts/). The clairvoyance Dockerfile does `COPY . .` (NOT `COPY app ./app`),
# so this exclusion is LOAD-BEARING: without it, the entire dragontts/ service
# (its own Dockerfile, pyproject, and app/ subpackage) would be baked into the
# clairvoyance image. Do NOT remove it thinking it's redundant. dragontts ships
# its own image via dragontts-docker-publish.yml (context: dragontts).
dragontts/
